03	Hybrid Economic Model and Asset Valuation (Global RWA Price Index)
Under the Tourism World Investment umbrella, the project relies on a multi-layered real asset index that determines the Value Floor to protect the value of tokens and digital assets and prevent random volatility on a global scale:
•	20% Global Gold Price: Hedging against inflation through real-time linkage to global gold prices using Chainlink Oracles.
•	30% Regional and International Markets and Services Index: A composite index tracking trade flows, global market movements, and economic project returns across target markets.
•	40% Global Activities and Services Index: Monitoring international trade activity, service flows, and the global business sector.
•	10% Group Ecosystem Profits: Profits directly tied to the group's operational projects and infrastructure worldwide.
